{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Keiki  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Primate Spirit Garden."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A facility located in the Animal Realm."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No. 02 — Wanna Create Something?$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It exists for the primate spirits...or so they say."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >Huh? Something like that happened on the surface world?"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Yeah, I thought you might know something."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >The Animal Realm didn't seem to be affected at all."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why so suspicious?"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >This stone was critical in solving the incident. But, no matter how you look at it, this violent youkai aura is..."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >Oh, this sensation, that's definitely the power of the Keiga Family's Saki"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Right? You think so too right?"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >Unfortunately, I can say without a doubt that's not the case."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Though that aura is certainly Saki's."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh? Meaning?"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >I mean, look at the stone, it's a truly incredible item."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >It doesn't just contain youkai aura, it's youkai aura turned into stone."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm sure this stone was made by a god.",
                "Not that it matters, since I’m one too."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >In other words, this stone isn't something an animal can make."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >If that's the case, aren't you the one who made it?"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Keiki  >Nice idea!"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm getting the urge to go create something!"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I might try my hand at it!"
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By defeating the goddess of unchanging, time has returned to Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems no one has any recollection about the incident."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yet, the Incident Stone still remains."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It is undeniable that it was thanks to this Incident Stone that the influence of the goddess of unchanging was staved off."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The search for the creator of the Incident Stones ended fruitlessly."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even after visiting the goddess of creation, that question remains unanswered."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, it is clear that the youkai aura of the stone belongs to Saki of the Keiga Family."
            ]
        }
    }
}